# Harsh Shukla Portfolio - Optional External AI API Configuration
# By default, the built-in fact-checking neural search engine runs deterministically on client-side knowledge base with 0 external API cost.
# To connect an external LLM backend (e.g. Google Gemini or OpenAI):

VITE_AI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# VITE_API_ENDPOINT=https://your-backend-api.com/api/chat
